<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-RUSSIA TAKE UNBEATABLE 3-0 LEAD OVER HUNGARY IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RUSSIA TAKE UNBEATABLE 3-0 LEAD OVER HUNGARY IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia took an unbeatable 3-0</p>
<p>lead over Hungary in their Davis Cup World group qualifying tie</p>
<p>after winning the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Yevgeny Kafelnikov/Andrei Olkhovsky beat Gabor Koves/Sandor</p>
<p>Nosai 7-6 (7-2) 6-3 6-1</p>
</text>
